            "text": "### Synthesis note\n\nThe deck exporter captures this canvas as a review snapshot. The text is intentionally styled with **bold labels**, short paragraphs, and bullet lists so the snapshot slide demonstrates how engineering rationale can travel with linked evidence.\n\n- Certification map: regulatory evidence and review rationale\n- Evidence binder: image, PDF, web previews, unsupported files\n- Deck curation: global slide ordering exercised by the exported PPTX",
